    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other games you would love</h1><p><br><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This game is a free prologue to the game Overwritten: Defeat The Net.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <i>Roguelike Deck Building:</i> Build your perfect deck one card at a time! Make every decision carefully as the offers are different every run.<br></li><li> <i>Control your &quot;minions&quot;:</i> Most of the cards in the game are cards that put an object in the playfield. You control those objects, buff them and turn them into powerful sources of damage or blocks, to defeat the enemies.<br></li><li> <i>On-screen calculator:</i> The first game to give you more focus on planning your strategy by taking care of the chore of counting and calculating numbers for you. Just drag a rectangle on the screen to select things you want to calculate, and the game will show you how many HP, Attacks, Blocks, RAM Cost,... they have in total.<br></li><li> <i>Cyberpunk theme:</i> In this game, you're an entity living in the digital space, you go through <strong>nodes</strong> to reach the center of the Net and defeat it. All cards and items in the game are computer programming-related.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "This game is a free prologue to the game Overwritten: Defeat The Net.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <i>Roguelike Deck Building:</i> Build your perfect deck one card at a time! Make every decision carefully as the offers are different every run.<br></li><li> <i>Control your &quot;minions&quot;:</i> Most of the cards in the game are cards that put an object in the playfield. You control those objects, buff them and turn them into powerful sources of damage or blocks, to defeat the enemies.<br></li><li> <i>On-screen calculator:</i> The first game to give you more focus on planning your strategy by taking care of the chore of counting and calculating numbers for you. Just drag a rectangle on the screen to select things you want to calculate, and the game will show you how many HP, Attacks, Blocks, RAM Cost,... they have in total.<br></li><li> <i>Cyberpunk theme:</i> In this game, you're an entity living in the digital space, you go through <strong>nodes</strong> to reach the center of the Net and defeat it. All cards and items in the game are computer programming-related.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A roguelike deckbuilding card game, and a free entry to the Net. Build your perfect deck and defeat your very first boss!",
